ts.status.wait_delay.body:
Many systems wait about 5 minutes before cooling (or heat-pump heating) starts again. That protects the equipment. Changing the setting during the wait can start it over.

1. Make one change, then don’t touch it for 5 minutes.

{step panel: WAIT}

ts.alert.capture.body:
Write down the exact code or message and what the system was doing. A photo works too.

A few messages have simple steps here: Wi-Fi, low battery, and the wait delay. Everything else goes to a pro.

{step panel: ALERT}
